#: ../../functions/func_countryname.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_countryname.rst:14
msgid "Returns the name of the country for the specified country code. If the country code is invalid an empty string will be returned. If ``translate`` is not blank, the output will be translated into the current locale language, otherwise it will be in English."
msgstr ""
"返回指定国家代码对应的国家名称。如果国家代码无效，将返回空字符串。如果 "
"``translate`` 不为空，输出将翻译为当前区域语言，否则为英文。"

